# Build Quantum Readiness Assessment Engine™ Pages

## Objective

Create and implement the **Quantum Readiness Assessment Engine™** under:

```txt
/dashboard/quantum-readiness
```

This module must provide executive, technical, AI advisory, simulation, and reporting capabilities for Post-Quantum Cryptography readiness assessment.

All pages must use real QGuard Helix data from existing assets, CBOM, TLS, PKI, identity, trust, telemetry, migration, and risk-scoring sources.

Do not use mock data, fake KPIs, hardcoded percentages, placeholder reports, or simulated production metrics unless explicitly marked as demo mode.

