# Scoring Model Requirements

Implement consistent scoring across the module.

## Quantum Readiness Score

Factors:

* PQC-ready assets
* Hybrid crypto adoption
* TLS maturity
* PKI maturity
* Identity migration maturity
* Crypto agility readiness
* Governance maturity
* Runtime visibility

## Quantum Risk Score

Factors:

* RSA/ECC exposure
* Legacy crypto
* HNDL exposure
* Internet-facing exposure
* Critical asset dependency
* Long-term data sensitivity
* Broken trust chains
* Weak certificates

## Migration Complexity Score

Factors:

* Asset count
* Dependency depth
* PKI complexity
* Identity complexity
* Cloud footprint
* Legacy systems
* Third-party dependencies
* Operational criticality

## HNDL Risk Score

Factors:

* Data sensitivity
* Data lifetime
* Retention period
* Adversary interest
* Business value
* Encryption strength
* Exposure surface

